  "notes": [
    "candleSnapshot on the xyz builder dex. The API serves only the most recent 5000 candles per coin and interval (documented; verified live: explicit earlier windows return nothing), so the earliest stored 1h candle is bounded by the first build date, not by the listing. Every run unions new candles into the stored history.",
